WEBVTT

00:00:59.026 --> 00:00:59.583
Huh?

00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:08.160
Saga!

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:10.759
Hey, is she all right?
What's wrong?

00:01:12.406 --> 00:01:16.706
There are fairies whose mission is
to create snowfall. Did you know?

00:01:17.678 --> 00:01:22.172
Because they can create snowfalls,
they are called "Snow Fairies".

00:01:25.719 --> 00:01:29.849
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:47.669
- Good morning!
- Oh! Good morning, Saga!

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:52.744
Thank you for waiting. Here is the
new house blend from "Little Me".

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:55.414
You're using me as a tester
for a new house blend, again.

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:59.882
Don't be so negative. Mr. Luchino said
he was confident in this one.

00:02:01.855 --> 00:02:03.186
Here you go.

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:08.058
Very well. Here is the reward for
bringing it all the way up here.

00:02:08.262 --> 00:02:11.288
Oh, no, no. No!
Instead...

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:49.602
As always, the morning sun
we can see from here is the best!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.431
But, isn't the admission fee
a little too much?

00:02:52.239 --> 00:02:55.037
- Hey, hey, Saga!
- Just kidding!

00:02:55.409 --> 00:02:58.469
By the way, how do you like
today's new house blend?

00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:00.877
Well, I would give it 65 points.

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:04.606
But, I brew it with lots of love.
Please add another 15 points!

00:03:04.818 --> 00:03:08.481
The total is 80 points?
Well, I guess it's all right.

00:03:09.156 --> 00:03:10.054
Bingo!

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:12.318
Then, I'll see you next week!

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:15.620
- Sure. Be careful going back.
- I will!

00:03:34.281 --> 00:03:36.146
Hi, there, Miss Saga.

00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:37.348
Good morning.

00:03:37.684 --> 00:03:40.175
You're an early riser on Sunday.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.583
Good morning. What are YOU doing,
Greta, so early in the morning? :

00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:47.324
Oh, I'm always up by this time.

00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:48.819
Ah!

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:53.466
You seem to have noticed, Saga.
That's right. This is a Swiss watch...

00:03:53.667 --> 00:03:57.103
...my father bought for me.
It looks perfect on me,

00:03:57.337 --> 00:04:01.000
the number one person in the class.
Don't you think so?

00:04:01.875 --> 00:04:03.809
Your pajamas are showing
under your skirt.

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:04.944
What?

00:04:05.178 --> 00:04:06.975
Oh, dear. I can't believe it.

00:04:07.214 --> 00:04:09.307
Please excuse me, Miss Saga.

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:21.486
Oh, well...

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.490
I'm home!

00:04:24.398 --> 00:04:27.094
Welcome home.
The breakfast is almost ready.

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:29.462
Then, I'm going to take a shower first.

00:04:33.206 --> 00:04:40.874
After breakfast, I'll help Mr. Luchino.
Then, finish shopping before lunch.

00:04:41.081 --> 00:04:44.175
I'm meeting with Norma and Anne
at 12:30.

00:04:44.384 --> 00:04:47.581
We'll do window shopping together
and have lunch.

00:04:47.788 --> 00:04:53.488
We'll take a half-an-hour break
in the park. I'll part from them at 3:50.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.527
Then, at 4 o'clock... Perfect!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:04.402
Grandma, I'll have lunch
with Norma and Anne today.

00:05:05.038 --> 00:05:06.335
All right. All right.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:09.637
By 6 o'clock I'll be home
with an empty stomach.

00:05:10.677 --> 00:05:14.841
Then, I'll have my special stew
simmering until you come home.

00:05:14.948 --> 00:05:15.915
I love it!

00:05:18.452 --> 00:05:22.047
Oh, no! It's already getting late!
Thank you for breakfast!

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:30.996
I'll be back.

00:05:38.004 --> 00:05:40.268
Oh, no!
I'll be late!

00:05:42.576 --> 00:05:43.838
Here she comes.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.577
Oh, hi, Miss Saga.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.840
Huh? Miss Saga?

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.010
Miss Saga! Where are you going?

00:05:54.221 --> 00:05:58.123
Ugh... Sorry, Greta.
I'm a little in a hurry.

00:05:58.358 --> 00:06:00.349
- Later!
- Excuse me, Miss Saga.

00:06:00.427 --> 00:06:04.591
Don't you have something to tell me?
See? See? See?

00:06:13.173 --> 00:06:14.140
Good.

00:06:16.443 --> 00:06:17.637
Mr. Paul, Good morning!

00:06:17.878 --> 00:06:22.315
Good morning, Saga.
Shortcut again? You got dirty!

00:06:22.849 --> 00:06:26.410
I'm fine. I'm fine! By the way,
can I do it just for a while?

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.521
Well, it's not exactly a good...

00:06:29.723 --> 00:06:31.020
It'll be fine. It'll be fine!

00:06:42.736 --> 00:06:46.968
Good morning, Mr. Luchino.
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:52.439
Good morning.
You're only a little late.

00:06:52.846 --> 00:06:56.942
Don't be too lenient. Whether by
one minute or one hour,

00:06:57.150 --> 00:07:00.381
tardy is tardy. I have to make up
for as long as I was late.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:01.812
Ah, I almost forgot.

00:07:02.355 --> 00:07:05.916
Today's "Little Me Special House
Blend" got 80 points.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:08.552
Huh?
Oh, really?

00:07:09.029 --> 00:07:13.864
80 points? Hah! That old man
said that? Not bad at all.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:17.026
Mr. Luchino. Don't be content
with just 80 points!

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:18.532
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:18.772 --> 00:07:21.639
Let's hurry up and get ready. Or, we
won't be able to open for business.

00:07:21.708 --> 00:07:25.906
All right. Phew. I wonder which one of
us is the owner.

00:07:41.828 --> 00:07:44.490
I'm not going to let you ignore me
this time, Miss Saga.

00:07:46.433 --> 00:07:49.231
Welcome.
What can I get for you?

00:07:49.903 --> 00:07:52.963
Uh... Where is Saga?

00:07:53.273 --> 00:07:55.138
Mr. Luchino, I need to go.
I'll be back tomorrow.

00:07:55.542 --> 00:07:57.510
I'll be waiting, Saga.

00:07:57.811 --> 00:08:01.144
Ah, Greta! What's up?
Shopping?

00:08:01.548 --> 00:08:05.177
- Uh, yes.
- Well, I'm in a hurry. Bye!

00:08:06.586 --> 00:08:08.850
- Be careful, Saga.
- I will!

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.058
What can I get for you?

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:16.117
What? Ah! That's right.
Um... I'll take this and that.

00:08:27.107 --> 00:08:28.506
Anne!

00:08:29.476 --> 00:08:31.410
Sorry. Did you wait?

00:08:31.611 --> 00:08:34.079
As usual, I waited about 5 minutes.

00:08:34.147 --> 00:08:37.981
Oops! Huh? What about Saga?
She hasn't come yet?

00:08:38.184 --> 00:08:39.481
She's definitely here.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:44.115
...this and this. If you give me a good
price for all of these, I'll take them.

00:08:44.324 --> 00:08:46.593
See? Isn't it a great deal?

00:08:46.593 --> 00:08:48.584
Hmmm... I can't say no to Saga.

00:08:48.762 --> 00:08:50.093
- Here you are.
- Thank you!

00:08:50.497 --> 00:08:54.934
Here is an extra one for free. Ask your
Grandma to bake an apple pie.

00:08:55.035 --> 00:08:59.233
Wait a minute! You shouldn't
give away extras so easily!

00:08:59.339 --> 00:09:03.742
Do you have a solid business plan to
make money? Make light of an apple,

00:09:03.943 --> 00:09:06.605
you'll cry over one apple.
Well, I have no choice.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:09.214
Shall I come up with the plan
for you? Let's see...

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:13.586
He wanted to give you an extra,
you should have taken it. What a waste.

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:18.421
No! Unless I clarify that kind of thing,
I feel somehow uneasy.

00:09:21.428 --> 00:09:23.862
You're definitely missing out, Saga.

00:09:24.064 --> 00:09:25.258
Do you think so?

00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:28.196
Well, Anne, don't you agree?

00:09:28.301 --> 00:09:30.667
Hmmm, I'm at a loss.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.565
You don't need to.

00:09:32.672 --> 00:09:34.697
But, they all look delicious!

00:09:34.908 --> 00:09:36.808
- Wow!
- Wow!

00:09:36.976 --> 00:09:39.945
See? You can't decide, can you?
Saga, which one will you have?

00:09:40.113 --> 00:09:42.946
Hmm... Let's see...

00:09:45.218 --> 00:09:48.585
Strawberry Cream for Norma.
Anne will have Cinnamon Apple,

00:09:48.755 --> 00:09:50.245
and I will have Marmalade flavor.

00:09:50.423 --> 00:09:51.515
- O.K.
- O.K.

00:09:52.192 --> 00:09:54.217
I will take two Plain ones, too.

00:09:54.427 --> 00:09:55.724
- What? Two more?
- What? Two more?

00:09:55.929 --> 00:09:59.729
One for my Grandma and the other
for my late night snack!

00:10:01.067 --> 00:10:03.126
Ah, this one is really good, too.
Try it.

00:10:03.369 --> 00:10:05.929
Let me try.
Hmmm...

00:10:06.139 --> 00:10:09.575
No wonder it was featured
in a magazine. Now, next time,

00:10:09.776 --> 00:10:11.243
let's try that Pizza restaurant!

00:10:11.377 --> 00:10:13.345
Then, I need to make a plan.

00:10:13.546 --> 00:10:16.071
Next Sunday, I'll be helping out at
Mr. Luchino's store in the morning...

00:10:16.282 --> 00:10:18.477
She's already making a new plan.

00:10:18.685 --> 00:10:22.644
Really! Saga is so reliable. She makes
decisions quickly for us.

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:27.548
Just count on me! I will make plans
efficiently and perfectly!

00:10:28.061 --> 00:10:29.426
It's good. It's good.

00:10:29.963 --> 00:10:32.227
What are you doing, Phil?

00:10:32.899 --> 00:10:36.892
Don't be so upset. I'll let you help us
with our new invention.

00:10:37.103 --> 00:10:38.695
Then, we'll be even.

00:10:39.873 --> 00:10:41.704
Is Saga going to help us?

00:10:42.108 --> 00:10:43.700
Then, please carry this.

00:10:44.444 --> 00:10:47.880
Why do I have to get involved with your
rummage play!

00:10:48.081 --> 00:10:51.141
I'm spending precious time
with Norma and Anne!

00:10:51.518 --> 00:10:53.611
I've found you, Miss Saga.

00:10:53.987 --> 00:10:58.014
What a shame. You're wasting a chance
to witness the invention of the century.

00:10:58.258 --> 00:11:00.453
I'd rather NOT witness it.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:01.649
Ah, Miss Saga.

00:11:02.428 --> 00:11:06.023
Finally I've caught up. Oh, no.
What a coincidence...

00:11:06.199 --> 00:11:09.225
to see you at such a place!

00:11:14.307 --> 00:11:19.244
I'm already late! I'm sorry, Norma
and Anne, but I need to get going.

00:11:19.445 --> 00:11:21.811
- We know.
- We'll see you at school tomorrow.

00:11:22.582 --> 00:11:25.415
I'm sorry.
Greta, thank you.

00:11:25.685 --> 00:11:28.711
What? You... you're welcome.

00:11:29.155 --> 00:11:29.883
See you!

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:31.982
What was that all about?

00:11:32.225 --> 00:11:33.214
Wow! Awesome!

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.422
I think we can use this
for our experiment.

00:11:35.628 --> 00:11:37.687
- Let me see.
- Ugh! Excuse me, all of you!

00:11:37.864 --> 00:11:40.856
- How does this work? Let's take it apart.
- Don't touch it with dirty hands!

00:11:41.067 --> 00:11:42.091
No, no, no! Stop it!

00:11:49.542 --> 00:11:50.440
Mr. Paul...

00:12:27.146 --> 00:12:30.946
Oh, no. The weather forecast was wrong.

00:12:31.217 --> 00:12:34.243
Hold on a minute.
I'll go get you an umbrella.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:37.753
It's not a big deal.
I'll see you tomorrow!

00:12:38.124 --> 00:12:40.649
- Be careful!
- I will!

00:13:03.683 --> 00:13:06.652
I should have borrowed an umbrella.

00:13:57.337 --> 00:13:59.305
Are you hungry?

00:14:00.173 --> 00:14:01.663
Ah! You know what?

00:14:08.281 --> 00:14:09.942
Here. Eat it.

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:46.341
What shall I do with this?

00:14:48.721 --> 00:14:50.018
Grandma! Grandma!

00:14:50.223 --> 00:14:52.191
Oh, dear. You're soaking wet.

00:14:52.325 --> 00:14:54.520
By the way, I picked up
something weird!

00:14:54.727 --> 00:14:55.785
Something weird?

00:14:55.995 --> 00:14:59.795
Well. Huh? Huh?
Huh?

00:15:00.233 --> 00:15:04.795
We'll talk about the weird thing
after a bath. Or, you'll catch a cold.

00:15:05.238 --> 00:15:06.205
All right.

00:15:09.175 --> 00:15:10.836
I wonder what it was.

00:15:12.345 --> 00:15:16.304
A new doll product?
A new breed of pet?

00:15:16.516 --> 00:15:19.417
A fairy? Could it be an alien?

00:15:20.753 --> 00:15:22.186
Hah... it was real.

00:15:24.257 --> 00:15:25.315
A waffle-eating alien...

00:15:25.525 --> 00:15:28.153
There is no way such a thing exists.

00:15:32.331 --> 00:15:34.492
Ah! It was delicious!

00:15:35.501 --> 00:15:37.935
Saga, when you're done taking a bath,
we'll have dinner!

00:15:38.104 --> 00:15:39.071
All right!

00:15:42.675 --> 00:15:44.905
Hmm. Just my imagination, I guess.

00:15:45.244 --> 00:15:47.371
Grandma, can I help you with anything?

00:15:49.015 --> 00:15:52.542
- Yeah! Yeah!
- Did you warm up? Dinner's almost ready.

00:15:53.853 --> 00:15:57.687
- Yahoo! It smells good!
- It's your favorite potato stew.

00:15:58.491 --> 00:15:59.958
- I'm going to get hungry again soon!
- Grandma...

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:02.087
- What is it?
- That...

00:16:02.328 --> 00:16:05.661
What? Do I have something
on my face?

00:16:05.865 --> 00:16:06.889
It's not that...

00:16:09.969 --> 00:16:11.704
Oops! What are you doing?

00:16:11.704 --> 00:16:13.569
Let go of me!
What's wrong? A bug?

00:16:13.739 --> 00:16:17.675
Ah! Let go!
What? Ah, no! Nothing!

00:16:24.851 --> 00:16:27.820
Excuse me! What are you doing to me
all of a sudden?

00:16:28.921 --> 00:16:30.115
You! Are you listening?

00:16:30.356 --> 00:16:35.760
Oops! Come on!
Why are you staring at me?

00:16:35.928 --> 00:16:40.262
What? What? Can you see me?
Fantastic!

00:16:51.077 --> 00:16:53.875
I can't find it anywhere,
anything about this itsy-bitsy thing.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.707
I'm not an itsy-bitsy thing!

00:16:55.781 --> 00:16:59.217
I'm Sugar! I'm a Season Fairy, Sugar!

00:16:59.385 --> 00:17:04.379
I see. That's right. If I use my common
sense, it's nothing but an illusion.

00:17:04.557 --> 00:17:07.754
Illusion! I just imagined I could see it.

00:17:08.861 --> 00:17:09.885
Saga! Dinner time!

00:17:10.062 --> 00:17:12.087
- O. K!
- O. K!

00:17:25.511 --> 00:17:27.570
Ah! Delicious!

00:17:31.651 --> 00:17:33.243
Huh? What's wrong, Saga?

00:17:33.386 --> 00:17:35.286
You didn't like it?

00:17:35.354 --> 00:17:37.481
Ah, it's not that.

00:17:38.424 --> 00:17:41.518
Delicious! As always,
Grandma's stew is the best!

00:17:41.794 --> 00:17:45.195
Me, too! Grandma's stew is the best!

00:17:45.364 --> 00:17:49.357
Huh? I wonder if it's a bug or something.
Strange...

00:17:49.535 --> 00:17:53.164
Just as I thought...
Grandma can't see it.

00:17:53.973 --> 00:17:55.941
- Thank you for dinner.
- Thank you for dinner.

00:18:04.083 --> 00:18:06.652
What a persistent illusion.

00:18:06.652 --> 00:18:11.851
Yeah! Yeah! Look at me! Look at me!
It's fun! Yeah!

00:18:13.859 --> 00:18:18.455
Look at me! Look at me!
Let's play together!

00:18:18.698 --> 00:18:21.258
Hello? Hello?

00:18:21.334 --> 00:18:22.801
Come on!

00:18:26.372 --> 00:18:32.072
Oh, no! Stop it! Someone! Help me!
Whoa! Oops!

00:18:33.913 --> 00:18:36.746
Please, please, let me look at this!
Oops! Whoa!

00:19:02.241 --> 00:19:04.402
What's this? It's fun.

00:19:04.477 --> 00:19:07.412
Let's do it together. Please, please!

00:19:12.618 --> 00:19:14.483
Huh?

00:19:18.224 --> 00:19:18.918
What?

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.635
Come on!

00:19:33.472 --> 00:19:36.669
Excuse me! You can see me. Right?

00:19:36.842 --> 00:19:40.112
Why are you ignoring me?
I'm talking to you! Ah!

00:19:40.112 --> 00:19:42.512
Whoa! My, oh-my.

00:19:46.752 --> 00:19:50.153
Ouch... ouch...

00:19:51.357 --> 00:19:55.521
If that's the case, I'm going to
use my last-resort magic!

00:19:55.861 --> 00:19:57.453
Magic?

00:20:00.266 --> 00:20:02.496
I am right here!

00:20:39.638 --> 00:20:40.696
Snow?

00:20:41.474 --> 00:20:43.942
Such easy magic is no big deal,

00:20:44.877 --> 00:20:47.402
because I am a Snow Fairy.

00:20:48.848 --> 00:20:50.179
A Snow Fairy?

00:20:50.616 --> 00:20:53.983
That's right. I'm a Snow Fairy, Sugar.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:55.414
Sugar?

00:21:20.045 --> 00:21:22.980
What a strange dream it was.

00:21:27.453 --> 00:21:31.981
Using magic last night made me hungry.
Do you have anything to eat?

00:21:33.492 --> 00:21:34.459
Huh?

00:21:34.527 --> 00:21:37.189
Impossible! Wasn't it a dream?

00:21:38.097 --> 00:21:40.964
Oh, no. I'm not gonna think about it!
I must still be sleeping!

00:21:43.903 --> 00:21:46.064
You, sleepy head!

00:21:51.544 --> 00:21:55.571
Sugar? A Snow Fairy? It's impossible,

00:21:55.781 --> 00:22:00.650
because it's not in my plans!

00:22:20.706 --> 00:22:24.267
Wishes upon the Moon,

00:22:25.344 --> 00:22:28.336
Melting in the water,

00:22:28.547 --> 00:22:33.610
I found a street lined with trees

00:22:33.886 --> 00:22:38.323
Songs of stardust

00:22:38.791 --> 00:22:46.197
The breeze crossing over the Bridge
of Rainbows

00:22:47.566 --> 00:22:51.900
You already knew...

00:22:52.738 --> 00:22:56.902
...the happiness of connecting
our hearts.

00:22:57.510 --> 00:22:59.137
Sugar Snow

00:23:00.279 --> 00:23:06.707
When powdery snow whirls in town,

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:12.823
the season of flower blossoms is near

00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:16.991
And, I think of you

00:23:19.598 --> 00:23:26.128
The love that melts our hearts and...

00:23:26.372 --> 00:23:35.371
...the dreams are in your heart.

00:23:40.185 --> 00:23:43.211
Preview for the Next Episode
Waffo!
I'm an apprentice Snow Fairy, Sugar.

00:23:43.289 --> 00:23:48.989
Nice to meet... Not! That's not right!
Who are you? Why are you here?

00:23:49.094 --> 00:23:53.463
How come only I can see you?
I have no idea what's going on!

00:23:53.599 --> 00:23:57.467
- This waffle is delicious!
- Hey! Listen to me!

00:23:57.536 --> 00:24:00.471
Oh, no... how will my life change?

00:24:01.006 --> 00:24:04.703
"A Little Snow Fairy, Sugar"
The next episode is
"An Itsy-Bitsy Roommate".

00:24:04.910 --> 00:24:07.936
Well, where is my bed?
Hello? Excuse me?
